  "name": "Chicken and Ham Casserole with Mustard Dumplings",
  "subtitle": "A hearty one-pot chicken casserole finished with savory mustard dumplings.",
  "description": "Chicken, ham, vegetables, and peas simmer in a cider-stock sauce, then bake beneath parsley and mustard dumplings until golden and firm.",
